# CoreOS runs on Claude. Set your Anthropic API key to enable live responses.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com — copy this file to .env.local and
# fill it in for local development, or set it on the hosting service.
#
# Without a key the app still runs: every agent returns a clearly-labelled
# canned reply instead of a real answer.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
